    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_cereals_grains; processing_state=manufactured): Farinaceous preparations (macaroni, vermicelli, crackers/biscuit, starch, dextrine) belong with Cereals; other starch headings (htc:1561, htc:1572) are already here. Layer-1 observations: 25 rows, 1833–1906. Series: HCPP_Annual Statement of Trade ×21; KEW_CUST 4 ×4. Units: CWTS (Hundredweights) ×21; Lbs. (Pounds) ×4. Top routes: Canada → England ×4; World → United Kingdom ×4; France → United Kingdom ×3; Other Parts → United Kingdom ×3."@en ;
